# calls to /connect/token, which is what "identity provider" traffic actually
# hits (there is no separate identity host; identity_url defaults to this
# same tradingapis.efghermesone.com base URL, see config.py). Failure
# re-confirmed live via CERTIFICATE_VERIFY_FAILED / self-signed-in-chain on
# 2026-09-13 once the old pin no longer matched the server's rotated cert.
